<title>USA: US cash DAP, ammonia prices steady-weak.</title>
<headline>US cash DAP, ammonia prices steady-weak.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash DAP and ammonia prices were steady to weak Friday, fertilizer dealers said.</p>
<p>Domestic demand was light for both DAP and ammonia, but export demand was strong enough to prevent sharp drops in prices, dealers said.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton	  Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   177-180		    DN $2.00-UNC</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188			  UNC</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   218-220		    DN $2.00-UNC</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
